{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-commutative-chirality-vanishes-interpretation","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:commutative-chirality-vanishes-interpretation","kind":"remark","title":"Significance: chirality is the unique S-odd channel, trivial in the commutative limit","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/cor-commutative-chirality-vanishes","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-frobenius-s-classification"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/cor-commutative-chirality-vanishes","text":"commutative-chirality-vanishes-interpretation.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:commutative-chirality-vanishes-interpretation\"></a><p>The Frobenius--Hopf antipode is trivial in the commutative QOU\n(<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S = \\mathrm{id}</code> when the multiplication is commutative), so any\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S</code>-anti-invariant degree of freedom must vanish. The chirality\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_3</code> — the unique <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S</code>-odd channel by\n<a href=\"#prop:frobenius-s-classification\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mass-formula-derivation\">Frobenius S-classification</a> —\nis therefore identically zero in the classical limit, and the\nmass formula degenerates to the two surviving <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S</code>-even invariants\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_1</code> (trace) and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_2</code> (determinant).</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/commutative-chirality-vanishes-interpretation.md","heading":"Remark","number":"13.2.23","page":"b/rem-commutative-chirality-vanishes-interpretation","qa":{"counts":{"pass":61,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":61},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}}}
